### Echo API — REST Client collection (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client)
### Run top to bottom. @token / @refresh are captured from the login response.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register (public)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@echo.app",
  "password": "Password123",
  "name": "Demo User"
}

### Login (public) — captures tokens
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@echo.app",
  "password": "Password123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Full profile + preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a tag
# @name tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Long Term", "color": "#06b6d4" }

### List tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an investment
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/investments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nifty 50 Index Fund",
  "type": "mutual_fund",
  "investedAmount": 200000,
  "currentValue": 246500,
  "riskLevel": "medium",
  "investmentDate": "2022-04-01",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "symbol": "NIFTY50",
  "tags": ["{{tag.response.body._id}}"]
}

### List investments (with filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/investments?type=mutual_fund&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Net worth (current)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/networth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Advisor recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/advisor/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Price quote (mock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prices/NIFTY50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }
